rule refund_limit v1
description "How much of what is left can be refunded at once"

inputs
  left : money[USDc]  range >=0USDc <=10000000USDc  fed by chobo "refunds.book" account remaining

outputs
  band : number  round down(1)

table band_of
policy unique
| left       | -> band : number |
| <=1000USDc | 0                |
| >1000USDc  | 2                |
